{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13101050","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13101050","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1310105001:0":{"text":"I was scared out of my mind back there. I really thought I was done for...","source_cn":"刚才可真是吓死我了……还以为我这次要死在路上了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3B71444B5FBB6C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1310105002:0":{"text":"I've been down this road over a dozen times, and I've never seen it this dangerous!","source_cn":"这条路我走了十六七回，这么危险还是第一次！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C98EE0E4B635F0C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310105003:0":{"text":"Honestly, if it weren't for the <style=\"highlight\">Snowspire Festival</style>, who'd come to Whiteridge in this freezing weather?","source_cn":"唉，要不是为了<style=highlight>冬日祭...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x61CD288D056DD564","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1310105004:0":{"text":"Oh, I almost forgot to thank you. Sorry, I get really chatty when I'm nervous...","source_cn":"哎呀，忘了谢谢你们了。我一紧张就话多……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6F427F86E77C292","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1310105004":{"text":"Oh, I almost forgot to thank you. Sorry, I get really chatty when I'm nervous...","source_cn":"哎呀，忘了谢谢你们了。我一紧张就话多……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6F427F86E77C292","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1310105005:0":{"text":"Don't be so modest. You saved my life! So I'm guessing you're headed to the festival too?","source_cn":"不，这不是客气，你们真的救了我的命啊！你们……看样子像...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13778249D9E2E23D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1310105006:0":{"text":"Yup! It's our first time here.","source_cn":"对呀，我们是第一次来呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C47F4C82FCF30DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1310105012:1":{"text":"Since we're all heading to <style=\"highlight\">Cedartown</style> for the festival, why don't we stick together?","source_cn":"既然都是去<style=highlight>雪松镇</...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F98C5A35B7C750C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1310105013:0":{"text":"Oho! We can keep you safe. No need to fret about wild animals or pesky bandits with us around!","source_cn":"嚯哈哈，有我们几个在，你也不用担心什么野兽和强盗了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3D75EF997A6910B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1310105014:0":{"text":"That's great! I was starting to worry about the road ahead.","source_cn":"那太好了！大家都顺路，正好我也在担心后面的路该怎么走呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6729ABD54D7FEC6A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1310105015:1":{"text":"In return for keeping me safe, I can be your guide when we get there.","source_cn":"等到了雪松镇，我可以给你们做向导，带你们好好逛一逛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F467F1ECD846E11","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:15:1310105015":{"text":"In return for keeping me safe, I can be your guide when we get there.","source_cn":"等到了雪松镇，我可以给你们做向导，带你们好好逛一逛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F467F1ECD846E11","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1310105016:0":{"text":"Not to brag, but I know Cedartown like the back of my hand. I know everything about that town! Let me tell ya...","source_cn":"这可不是我说大话，我去雪松镇就像回自家一样。镇上有什么...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC943FBDC3FF60E87","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1310105017:0":{"text":"Ahem! Now, let's get a wiggle on, shall we? It'll be dark before we know it!","source_cn":"咳，还是先赶路吧，等会就要天黑了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x764A42BC91C58BD2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1310105018:0":{"text":"Oh right, there's still a long way to go. Let's walk and I'll tell you all about Cedartown.","source_cn":"啊对，还得走好一段路呢。咱们先走吧，路上我再跟你们好好...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A308036C331F6E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:15:0:1":{"text":"Are you familiar with Cedartown?","source_cn":"你很熟悉雪松镇？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xCDC22289AEE8EC2B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Are you familiar with Cedartown?","female":"Are you familiar with Cedartown?","variant_male_record_index":"68122","variant_female_record_index":"68123","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:0:1":{"text":"It's not a big deal.","source_cn":"顺手之事，不用客气","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1020341DDAB0F31C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"It's not a big deal.","female":"It's not a big deal.","variant_male_record_index":"68116","variant_female_record_index":"68117","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1310105007:0":{"text":"Are you going as well? That's great!","source_cn":"对呀，你们也是？那太巧了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBF8F6478AA4C259","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1310105008:0":{"text":"I'm mainly here for the festival, but I'm also stocking up on goods from Whiteridge to sell.","source_cn":"我这次主要就是为了祭典，顺便收购些白山特产回去卖。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x08CE7B7B87EC88B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:1:2":{"text":"You're heading to the festival?","source_cn":"你也是去参加祭典？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x790734A94BA0D3C2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You're heading to the festival?","female":"You're heading to the festival?","variant_male_record_index":"68118","variant_female_record_index":"68119","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1310105009:0":{"text":"Haha, I'm just a small-time trader. I came to buy some local specialties.","source_cn":"嗐，我就是个小商人，来白山收购些本地特产。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC14CCCA92D8C8678","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1310105010:0":{"text":"But besides that, I'm also here for the Snowspire Festival. You've heard of it, right?","source_cn":"当然啦，这回除了进货，也是来参加祭典的，哎，冬日祭典你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF21E6D64A71E7086","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1310105011:0":{"text":"Of course! The festival is why we're here!","source_cn":"当然，我们也是来参加祭典的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x203A311372D9ED29","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:2:3":{"text":"You look like a merchant.","source_cn":"看起来你是个行商？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3B53DE803C962FDC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You look like a merchant.","female":"You look like a merchant.","variant_male_record_index":"68120","variant_female_record_index":"68121","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:商人斯瓦夫":{"text":"Trader Swafford","source":"商人斯瓦夫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"Chippy","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:呼金":{"text":"Hugin","source":"呼金","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":25,"localized_text_count":24,"speaker_count":3}}